793ee7e682e206e0914754cf60fd93af0792c463`.\n- Original annotated tag object: `13c6d9632d1f2e41bc32c6b39a5db7999050c76e`.\n- Reviewed infrastructure tree: `6abe465ee6775405df2441b2cda76f8c8bfd20d5` (25 files), preserved exactly from local preparation `d6da4d645c117c0075173b54bb0bae5563b701a5`; PR successor merely adds the safe empty-main ancestor.\n- Expected inventory: **1,085 files / 590,842,992 bytes**, below the 800,000,000-byte cap.\n- Inventory SHA-256: `af53bba40a5726c0959c1433f0e03f4813eca8f6ef4086f8d82dd2900ff326ec`.\n- Original qualification SHA-256: `f1c01e8d8f928572994409647e7a5be74faa8f294d00ee08b42c23982952563e`. Later corroboration is not substituted.\n\nThe narrow v2 consumer mirrors the reviewed main consumer: source-bound policy, five mandatory successful gates, explicit waived/null test counts, evidence structure and frozen/build proof. Legacy v1 six-gate behavior remains intact. Raw policy bytes are checked against the exact source both before and after extraction. All original nine release assets remain recorded; no game-release/tag/asset writes occur here.\n\n## Validation and temporary test waiver\n\nActual metadata/schema/provenance checks passed locally; the actual archived v1 input still yields its unchanged 1,063-file / 590,419,655-byte inventory. Automated suites were **NOT RUN under the user's explicit temporary waiver**, not reported as passing. PR Actions must still complete the guarded original-ZIP extraction/build, exact source/tag/policy checks, all byte hashes and inventory/capacity checks. Strict 3 GiB workspace guard is retained. No full payload was downloaded or built locally.\n\n## Why not merged yet, dependencies, and next steps\n\nThis PR is intentionally held for coordinator review of its exact-head hosted preview and bounded receipts. The v0.85.0 published-release handoff has been received, enabling this archive-preservation lane; that does not authorize an unreviewed selector or deployment.\n\n1. Require successful exact-head hosted preview; inspect original-source, extraction and complete-inventory receipts.\n2. Coordinator independently reviews the PR/head/tree and explicitly authorizes the merge/deploy lane.\n3. Merge with a merge commit, preserve all branches, and deploy only through the guarded main Actions workflow.\n4. Verify complete public HTTP path/size/hash/MIME inventory and honest scoped browser admission.\n5. Coordinator integrates approved archive admission into a separate reviewed main Pages-selector PR.\n\nNo merge or deployment is claimed by this PR. No gameplay, offline or device checks are claimed. Existing archive refs/routes, the shared dirty checkout and owner worktrees remain untouched.\n","created_at":"2026-09-22T21:49:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T21:49:08Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"bd095f5033cd278d695102c621cdd3415fe60bcd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline-archive-53/pulls/1/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline-archive-53/pulls/1/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline-archive-53/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline-archive-53/issues/1/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline-archive-53/statuses/c5d51ff845f09a24ed41c50f01a0a308978113bf","head":{"label":"mekhovov:codex/preserve-v0840-archive53","ref":"codex/preserve-v0840-archive53","sha":"c5d51ff845f09a24ed41c50f01a0a308978113bf","user":{"login":"mekhovov","id":194539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDUzOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me